{"ID":"20240118151132-lgtv6ce","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151132-lgtv6ce","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151132-lgtv6ce\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151132-xry4f3c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130844-kwufc4g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122130713-9mke5vb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:307,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:307\u0026#125;","title":"189水萍（浮萍）","type":"doc","updated":"20240201104414"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151132-xry4f3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151132-xry4f3c","updated":"20240122130612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，寒，无毒．治暴热身痒，下水气，胜酒，长须发，止消渴。久服轻身。生池泽水上．一名水花或浮萍。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130615-tvwl4fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130615-tvwl4fg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，浮生于河泽水面．无根，叶大而面青背紫者谓之浮萍，有须根数条。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130616-uxuyuvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130616-uxuyuvr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】水萍味辛，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130618-pg4w3th","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130618-pg4w3th"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】水萍为解热，发汗，利水，祛湿药。能消皮肤肿痒，治水肿，风疹，丹毒，小便不利，目赤翳膜，外治敷疮肿。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130620-lv88caf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130620-lv88caf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主风湿，麻痹，脚气，打扑损伤，目赤翳膜，口舌生疮，衄血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130621-uoa0j2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130621-uoa0j2o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】捣汁服，主水肿，利小便。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130623-8f8hkt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130623-8f8hkt3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治热毒，风热，热狂，熁肿毒，汤火伤，风疹。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130624-7rvf8vq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130624-7rvf8vq"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】下气，以沐浴生毛发。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130626-9volz3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130626-9volz3q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】其性清浮，治在肌表。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130627-rirwzkn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130627-rirwzkn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通八分至二钱。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130628-wpb1t9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130628-wpb1t9a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】发汗力猛，证非大实大热者，不可轻用，表虚自汗者尤忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130629-apu1p6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130629-apu1p6w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】水气洪肿——小便不利者，浮萍日干为未，每服方寸匕，日二。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130634-lv0otds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130634-lv0otds"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"身上虚痒——浮萍末一钱，以黄芩一钱，用四物汤煎汤调下。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122130612-ydypw1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130612-ydypw1g"}},{"ID":"20240122130639-koaajub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130639-koaajub","updated":"20240201103402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个到189，本经里面说水萍。实际上就是我们现在讲的什么，浮萍。浮萍大家都认得。到花市或者哪里你去看，浮在水面上的几片叶子，拉起来几根根在下面，那就是浮萍。"}]},{"ID":"20240122130640-wo7hqum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130640-wo7hqum","updated":"20240201103614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们治疗一个病，风疹，最好用浮萍，你说那老师为什么风疹最好用浮萍？用中药呢，一再强调要以意得。这个风疹呢没有受到风是不发，隐藏在那里，一喝酒出来风一吹到马上发风疹，或吃了螃蟹，吃了虾子马上肿就起来，平常都看不到呢？怎么一发就发起来呢？这就是风疹。一发起来很厚，皮肤整个肿起来，很痒又难过，又痒又刺。浮萍呢还是一样，风一吹它到处跑啊。这是一个。你们千万不要只开一味药浮萍哦，那我只是告诉你的药性而已。第二个，它是浮在水上面的，它的根在水下面没有根的，它浮在水上面，你想想看，它轻飘飘的，可以飘浮在水上面，它是不是利水利尿很强，它靠水可以活在里面，你漂在水上看看，它可以漂能活到，那根吸收水的力量很强，所以它一定排水的力量很好，中药就这样子来的。还有呢，皮肤病，他是不是皮肤病嘛，风疹，皮肤病嘛，效果也很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240122130653-nnqxdtq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130653-nnqxdtq","updated":"20240201103750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去临床上面我们在做的时候，诸位看，你把浮萍拿起来一咬，好辣。味辛。这个它能够下水气、胜酒，辛辣的东西都能够解酒，能够长须发，止消渴，这个呢，我们取用的时候，是面青背紫，把浮萍叶子拉起来背后是紫色的，都可以用，。它是寒性的药。你看它主治的，浮萍呢是解热，发汗，利水的，祛湿的药，能够消皮肤肿、皮肤肿痒、水肿也可以、风疹、丹毒、眼刺、目翳，凡是热证在表面上看到的都可以加一点浮萍。"}]},{"ID":"20240122130713-9mke5vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130713-9mke5vb","updated":"20240201104414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是浮萍，把它切碎，晒干之后打碎了，就变成一点点。这个药本身的质很轻，所以你开浮萍，开一钱就一大堆了，你不用开到很重，开到五六钱这就一大包。那这个浮萍呢也可以作发汗的药，但这个浮萍的发汗跟麻黄桂枝的发汗那真是小巫见大巫。所以你要取它微汗，一点点汗的时候可以用浮萍。所以它只是在皮肤上表面上风疹效果是真的很好。徐灵胎说因为它药性轻浮，所以治在肌表，肌肉表面上，皮肤表面上都可以。那刘元素说浮萍能够下气。如果用浮萍来洗头能生毛发，那你洗头就好了，不要洗身体，对啊，这个commonsense嘛，老师我要洗全身长毛，这个就长头发好了，洗头可以用。所谓禁忌，因它发汗力猛，你光是单味的浮萍没有办法发汗的，一定要有些药配在里面才有办法去发汗。诸位看这个水蓄，红肿，身上须痒，复方，诸位可以参考一下"}]},{"ID":"20240122130844-kwufc4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122130844-kwufc4g"}}]}